{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそヽ(^^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/06/11/9850424/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま折り返し地点をすぎ、終盤へ向かう時期ですが、\nスランプに陥って\nなかなか二幕に出ることができません。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロザリオ役、\nエステル役2回、\nアンサンブルのメグ、\nアンサンブルのエリザベート\n侍女2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を演じさせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しかったし、やっぱり舞台っていいなって思いました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの期間、あとちょっとだし\nやっぱり二幕に出たいよ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張らなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/06/11/9850424/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕出れなかった子たちで\n3幕ではたまにこんな髪型してます(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでやれば怖くない。的な。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レアだよレア！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で10役制覇が3人に増えましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ももっとチャンスがあったり\n自信があればやりたかったな。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも、私は私らしく頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人を笑わせるのが大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ってる顔をみること、声を聞くのが大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の勢いを取り戻す！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/06/11/9850424/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は映像公演、\n渋谷PARCO劇場にて行われた\n「16人のプリンシパル」7日目\nを見てきました！！\n可愛かった！！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかみんな\n幼くて、全力で、から回って、自分に素直だった気がするよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返るのは怖くもあり、楽しみでもある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(モバメと同じこと言っちゃったよ！笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、今回のプリンシパルも振り返る時がくるのかなあ。。？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時は、今よりもっと成長してる自分自身でありたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな自分になれるように\n明日からも頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/06/11/9850424/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒14位の瞬間。笑\n涙の全てを拭き取れなかったこの顔。笑(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒おめでとう！！\nそして玲奈さん5位おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}